#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-navisys-gr901u.rst:5
#: fce11019b8e34300b0a3cd934233a496
msgid "Navisys GR-901U RTK base"
msgstr "Navisys GR-901U RTK 基站"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-navisys-gr901u.rst:10
#: 35361ee65c634daaa876055cbea7412e
msgid ""
"Navisys GR-901U is an advanced RTK base station. Equipped with u-blox "
"ZED-F9P engine, it features L1/L2 dual-band, centimeter-level accuracy and "
"supports multiple satellite systems, including GPS, GLONASS, BeiDou, "
"Galileo, and QZSS."
msgstr ""
"Navisys GR-901U 是一款先进的 RTK 基站。搭载 u-blox ZED-F9P 引擎，具备 L1/L2 "
"双频、厘米级精度，支持多卫星系统，包括 GPS、GLONASS、BeiDou、Galileo 和 QZSS。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-navisys-gr901u.rst:14
#: a16b5662c035425e879ca5d16d19ddba
msgid ""
"Navisys GR-901U is fully compatible with Ardupilot and provide high "
"precision GPS data for UAV/drone applications. Simply plug Navisys GR-901U "
"into a computer, it’s serving as an RTK Base in Ardupilot Mission Planner！"
msgstr ""
"Navisys GR-901U 与 ArduPilot 完全兼容，可为无人机应用提供高精度 GPS 数据。只需将 Navisys GR-901U "
"插入计算机，即可在 ArduPilot Mission Planner 中作为 RTK 基站使用！"

